Billing integration update for DQMS backend

1. Copy the files into the same paths in your backend repository.
2. Add the CLINIC_* variables from .env.billing.example to your existing .env.
3. Run:
   npm run seed:treatments
4. Restart the API:
   npm run dev

New dentist endpoint:
GET /api/dentist/treatment-types

New receptionist endpoints:
GET /api/receptionist/patients/:patientId/billing
GET /api/receptionist/invoices/:invoiceId
POST /api/receptionist/patients/:patientId/invoices/:invoiceId/payments

Appointment body now supports:
visitPurpose: NEW_TREATMENT | FOLLOW_UP | CHECKUP

NEW_TREATMENT creates an invoice after dentist ends the session.
FOLLOW_UP and CHECKUP do not create a new invoice.

Inventory unit prices are never used in invoice calculation.
